# The Fortis Colosseum for replays: map region 7216 (RuneLite's
# DiscordGameEventType.MG_FORTIS_COLOSSEUM), south-west corner 1792,3072. Schematic: an open floor
# at the region's template tiles; the lobby (7316, MG_FORTIS_COLOSSEUM_LOBBY) is loaded by the
# script when it leaves. "players can take on up to twelve waves of opponents"
# (oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Fortis_Colosseum)

scene 1772 3052
skill HITPOINTS 99
at 1820 3100
login

watch open arenas.openArena
watch coloRuns arenas.log.colosseum.runs.size
watch reached arenas.log.colosseum.active.reached
watch cleared arenas.log.colosseum.active.cleared
watch splits arenas.log.colosseum.active.splits
watch between arenas.between
watch caveRun book.active
